# 'Nothing gated' (docs/squeeze.md): the crew van from the park to dragon_gate by street (928 m), the driving autopilot on the
# sim's own traffic network (tools/squeeze/routes.ts writes this file). The van must arrive within 25 m of the route's end.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 57.5 -17.8 -1.1 270
tap use 30
bot drive 57.5,-15.6 72.0,5.6 100.5,9.4 118.0,32.8 115.6,62.5 113.1,91.8 110.6,121.5 108.8,149.6 105.5,178.7 113.4,206.3 122.9,232.4 152.3,234.7 181.7,233.9 211.0,232.1 240.4,231.9 256.2,255.6 276.5,275.7 266.2,302.6 261.6,331.7 257.4,360.1 252.8,388.6 248.6,415.0 244.2,442.7 239.8,470.4 236.4,499.7 248.8,515.1 266.9,515.8 281.4,529.8 277.0,557.5 272.5,585.3 268.5,610.5 264.2,637.4 262.9,645.7 262.9,645.7 from 100 speed 8 corner 4 stop
run 35038
expect skater.pos.x > 237.9 at 35038
expect skater.pos.x < 287.9 at 35038
expect skater.pos.y > 620.7 at 35038
expect skater.pos.y < 670.7 at 35038
